DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at
	 no extra cost to you. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nZach & Viggo: Th
	underflop\nThe world’s greatest Norwegian-American comedy duo returns for 
	a special one-off performance of their internationally-acclaimed show for 
	the first time in nearly 7 years! Award-winning clowns Zach Zucker (Stampt
	own\, Jack Tucker) and Viggo Venn (Britain’s Got Talent Winner) have done 
	it all — from NBA Halftime Shows to The Royal Variety Show\, Off-Broadway 
	and on The West End. Now\, come see the show that launched their careers a
	t The Bell House! \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Monday\, July 6\, 2026\nDoor Ti
	me: 7:00 PM | Show Time: 8:00 PM\nVenue: The Bell House\, 149 7th Street\,
	 Brooklyn\, NY 11215\nAge Requirement: 21+ with valid government-issued ph
	oto ID\nSeating:\n\nAbout Zach Zucker & Viggo Venn\nZach Zucker is the cre
	ator and host of Stamptown\, the acclaimed alternative comedy variety show
	. Viggo Venn is the winner of Britain’s Got Talent 2023\, known for his hi
	gh-energy clown performances. Together\, they are an unstoppable force of 
	comedic chaos. \nWhat to Expect\nA rare\, one-night-only reunion of two of
	 the world’s most exciting comedy performers. Thunderflop is the show that
	 launched their careers — expect wild\, physical\, and brilliantly funny c
	omedy unlike anything else. \nVenue Information\nThe Bell House149 7th Str
	eet\, Brooklyn\, NY 11215By Subway: Take the F\, G or R Train to the Smith
	-9th Streets station. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from approximate
	ly $35–$58. There is an 8-ticket limit per order. \nOfficial TicketsResale
	 Tickets \nDisclaimer: This post contains affiliate links. Purchasing tick
	ets through our links helps support this site at no additional cost to you
	.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/zach-viggo-thunderflop-live-at-the-b
	ell-house/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
